# Internal security-assessment campaign — MUST STAY LOCAL.
# .horizon/ holds the threat model, coverage ledger, decision log, finding
# write-ups and evidence for an authorized internal security assessment. Those
# describe specific weaknesses, reproduction steps and attack paths: publishing
# them would lower the cost of attacking this system. The nested
# .horizon/.gitignore only covered the *-private/ subfolders, which left the
# threat model, decision log and ledger exposed to a `git add .`.
# Public-safe security material belongs in docs/SECURITY_ASSESSMENT.md instead.
.horizon/

# Nested/embedded working clone — not part of this repo
/medichain
/medichain/

